Making my grandchild cry!{VAR BE01}
If they are underestimating me because
I'm old... Grrr!

Shut your trap!{VAR BE01}
If you stay here quietly,
we won't be rough.

What do they hope to accomplish
by occupying the island?{VAR BE00}
What a sketchy group!

What are they doing in this little
memorial park? There's nothing here{VAR BE00}
but an old lighthouse...

This officer's Pokémon couldn't stand up
to them!{VAR BE00}
That blasted Team Plasma!

entries.text:
Two hundred years ago, an ultra-rich
family bought this island and named it{VAR BE00}
Liberty Garden.{VAR BE01}
It's a place where people and Pokémon
could live freely.

This lighthouse shines with the light
of freedom.{VAR BE01}
Only authorized personnel may enter.

entries:
How's that Pokémon doing?{VAR BE01}
The island sure has been quiet since
that incident.

Professor Juniper: Thanks to you,
{VAR 0100 0000}, this group that was{VAR BE00}
up to no good has been captured!{VAR BE01}

Victini is a mythical Pokémon that is said
to radiate energy from its body...{VAR BE01}
When Pokémon or people come into contact
with that energy, it fills up their bodies,{VAR BE00}
and they exhibit more power than usual.{VAR BE01}
That's why there was no end to the
people who wanted to use Victini for{VAR BE00}
their own evil ends...{VAR BE01}
I'm sure the rich person who built this
underground room for Victini was{VAR BE00}
sincerely trying to help it.{VAR BE01}
But I think shutting the poor thing up in
this room was a mistake.{VAR BE01}
Thanks to you, Victini has a new destiny
that does not involve being used in{VAR BE00}
Team Plasma's schemes.{VAR BE01}
Making sure no one misuses Victini's
powers is now your duty!{VAR BE01}

Also...{VAR BE01}
In the Unova Pokédex, Victini was
assigned a special number: zero.{VAR BE01}
I've heard the special number was
assigned in the hope that Victini's power{VAR BE00}
to bring victory would be shared with the{VAR BE00}
Trainer who travels with this Pokédex...{VAR BE01}

Professor Juniper!{VAR BE01}
We cornered the crooks with our
high-speed police boat!{VAR BE01}
We will return to Castelia City!
Please come on board, too!{VAR BE01}

I can't believe it when people are led
astray by Pokémon's astounding abilities{VAR BE00}
and try to misuse them...{VAR BE01}
But it's only when we face Pokémon with a
good heart that we can make a{VAR BE00}
brighter future!{VAR BE01}
